// src/Optimize/CheckUniversalAnalytics.php, row 124
"Google stopped collecting Universal Analytics data on 1 July 2023. 1. In Google Analytics open Admin > the GA4 property of the site > Data streams > the web stream and copy its Measurement ID (G-...); if the site has no GA4 property, create one. 2. In the places listed: in gtag code write the G-... id instead of the UA-... one (in gtag/js?id= and in gtag('config', ...)) and keep the consent settings; delete the _gaq, ga.js, analytics.js and _gat blocks; where no gtag code is left, paste in the standard GA4 snippet. Replace a UA-... id in the site settings (Google Analytics tracking id) by the G-... id. 3. The next day check GA4 > Reports > Realtime that visits come in." => "A Google 2023. j\xFAlius 1-j\xE9n le\xE1ll\xEDtotta a Universal Analytics adatgy\xFBjt\xE9s\xE9t. 1. A Google Analyticsben nyissa meg: Adminisztr\xE1tor > a webhely GA4-tulajdona > Adatfolyamok > a webes adatfolyam, \xE9s m\xE1solja ki a M\xE9r\xE9si azonos\xEDt\xF3j\xE1t (G-...); ha a webhelynek nincs GA4-tulajdona, hozzon l\xE9tre egyet. 2. A felsorolt helyeken: a gtag k\xF3dban \xEDrja a G-... azonos\xEDt\xF3t az UA-... hely\xE9re (a gtag/js?id= c\xEDmben \xE9s a gtag('config', ...) h\xEDv\xE1sban is), a hozz\xE1j\xE1rul\xE1si be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1sokat hagyja meg; t\xF6r\xF6lje a _gaq, ga.js, analytics.js \xE9s _gat blokkokat; ahol nem marad gtag k\xF3d, illessze be a szabv\xE1nyos GA4-k\xF3dr\xE9szletet. A webhely be\xE1ll\xEDt\xE1saiban (Google Analytics k\xF6vet\xF5azonos\xEDt\xF3) cser\xE9lje az UA-... azonos\xEDt\xF3t a G-... azonos\xEDt\xF3ra. 3. M\xE1snap ellen\xF5rizze a GA4 > Jelent\xE9sek > Val\xF3s idej\xFB n\xE9zetben, hogy \xE9rkeznek-e l\xE1togat\xE1sok.", // ai 2026-10

// src/Optimize/CheckUniversalAnalytics.php, row 129
"%1 still has the old Google Analytics code (UA-...) next to the new one - it can be removed" => "%1 az \xFAj mellett m\xE9g a r\xE9gi Google Analytics-k\xF3dot (UA-...) is tartalmazza - ez elt\xE1vol\xEDthat\xF3", // ai 2026-10

// src/Optimize/CheckUniversalAnalytics.php, row 132
